OL,3,GNEWSAJudge rules police statement can
OL,4,Abe used in fatal crash trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge has ruled that a police
OL,7,Fstatement given by a man accused of
OL,8,Fcausing the deaths of three people in a
OL,9,Fmotorbike crash can be used in
OL,10,Fevidence.
OL,12,FNathon Gibbon, 33, is due to stand
OL,13,Ftrial next year accused of causing the
OL,14,Fdeaths of Jason Gibbon, Andrew Larty
OL,15,Fand Georgia Tate by driving a
OL,16,Fmotorcycle dangerously in the Scottish
OL,17,FBorders in July 2024.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
