OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAJudge rules police statement can
OL,4,Abe used in fatal crash trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is alleged that he engaged in a
OL,7,F"race or trial of speed" with the
OL,8,Fmotorcycle driven by Jason Gibbon,
OL,9,Fexceeded the speed limit and continued
OL,10,Fto drive at "excessive speeds" as he
OL,11,Fapproached a bend.
OL,13,FNathon Gibbon, of Ashington,
OL,14,FNorthumberland, denies the charge and
OL,15,Fis due to stand trial in August next
OL,16,Fyear.
